Đường dẫn Agent Card cho A2A discovery
Canonical (Claim:a2a-discovery-path/c/001): \item \textbf{Agent Card:} JSON tại \texttt{/.well-known/agent.json} --- announce capabilities, input/output schemas
Working (Claim:a2a-discovery-path/w/001): Agent Card tại \texttt{/.well-known/\textbf{agent.json}}
& A2A v0.3 đổi thành \texttt{/.well-known/\textbf{agent-card.json}}
Resolution: A2A v0.3 renamed the well-known Agent Card path from /agent.json to /agent-card.json; a client still using the old path gets a silent 404, not an error. Prefer working. Traces to RESEARCH-day26's corrected-claims table, row C4.

Bài lab thực tế của chính ngày 26 là gì
Canonical (Claim:day26-lab-assignment/c/001): \labframe{26}{Multi-Agent Infrastructure}{3-agent system (orchestrator + 2 specialists) via A2A + LangSmith trace}{2h}
Working (Claim:day26-lab-assignment/w/001): \labframe{26}{Fleet MCP/A2A Có Gateway \& Registry}{MCP server phi trạng thái 2 replica + registry riêng có pin/drift-alert + gateway route theo header + trace xuyên agent}{2h}
Resolution: Not a stale-number disagreement -- these describe two structurally different lab deliverables for the same course day. Working is the current build (stateless MCP fleet + registry + gateway); canonical's 3-agent/A2A description is superseded. This is the sharpest contradiction in the set: an agent citing 'day26's lab' must pick a replica, not average them.

